n class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a59e9cd2-58f4-47e8-8c97-74146b9de02e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a59e9cd2-58f4-47e8-8c97-74146b9de02e\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/38px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/50px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Nansi Gretta\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png/25px-Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Portrait_Nansi_Gretta.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nansi_Gretta\" title=\"Nansi Gretta\">Nansi Gretta</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This book, the completed manuscript of an adventure story in draft, is covered with notes in Nansi's hand. A few red-inked phrases stand out amid the chaos.]\n</p><p><br>\nThis isn't landing.\n</p><p>I don't buy it.\n</p><p>Doesn't ring true.\n</p><p>Did you mean to do it like this?\n</p><p>Could do with another pass.\n</p><p>Hah!\n</p><p>Get rid of whatever this is.\n</p><p>Good flow.\n</p><p>All right, I buy it.\n</p><p>Seriously?\n</p><p>Ah... like this? No.\n</p><p><br>\nIt will be good. But it's not there yet.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715062937\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1848/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31095/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8018/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936198/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.864      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.864      1 -total\n 57.71%   25.891      8 Template:Icon_text\n 50.67%   22.733     19 Template:Trim\n 23.24%   10.428      2 Template:Uid\n 15.39%    6.906      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.48%    6.496      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.10%    5.878      2 Template:Template_style\n  9.92%    4.448      8 Template:Ifempty\n  9.80%    4.396      2 Template:CharLink\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34848-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715062937 and revision id 364920. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}